<title>BRAZIL: SOCCER-SOUTH AMERICAN SUPERCUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SOUTH AMERICAN SUPERCUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South American</p>
<p>Supercup quarter-final, second leg matches played Wednesday:</p>
<p>In Belo Horizonte: Cruzeiro (Brazil) 1 Boca Juniors</p>
<p>(Argentina) 1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Cruzeiro - Paulinho (12th minute)</p>
<p>Boca Juniors - Gabriel Cedres (63rd minute, penalty)</p>
<p>Attendance: 41,000</p>
<p>Aggregate score 1-1. Cruzeiro win 7-6 on penalties</p>
<p>In Medellin: Atletico Nacional (Colombia) 3 Santos (Brazil)</p>
<p>1 (1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers</p>
<p>Atletico Nacional - Herman Gaviria (24th), John Jairo</p>
<p>Trellez (63rd), Mauricio Serna (76th, penalty)</p>
<p>Santos - Camanducaia (74th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 35,000</p>
<p>Aggregate score 3-3. Santos win 7-6 on penalties.</p>
<p>In Asuncion: Olimpia (Paraguay) 0 Velez Sarsfield</p>
<p>(Argentina) 1 (0-1)</p>
<p>Scorer: Patricio Camps (29th)</p>
<p>Attendance: 7,000</p>
<p>Velez Sarsfield win 4-0 on aggregate.</p>
</text>
